1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,920
One shop. Three servers.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:05,150
When its certificate renews,
which servers get the new copy?

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,180
With Certbot, renewal can be automatic.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,970
Your team still owns deployment across the fleet.

5
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:15,360
Turn on Cloudflare’s proxy,
and visitors reach Cloudflare first.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,130
RedirHub Edge takes a different route.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,460
RedirHub renews the certificate.

8
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,890
Each connected server syncs a copy.

9
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,200
Run the Edge container on each server,
then point your domain at them.

10
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,860
Open the shop.

11
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,900
The browser connects straight to your server.

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,680
Edge handles the encryption.

13
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,090
Your app keeps serving.

